    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's certifications, GDPR instruments, AI security controls, audit capabilities, and experience with the EU regulatory frameworks (GDPR, EU AI Act, RGS, SecNumCloud, NIS2) as of 2024, can our company's ensure that The solution meets these security and compliance requirements?" ;
