    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The segregation of duties is maintained between development and production operations, ensuring auditor independence and separation of duties. our company's hosting partner, OuraneCloud, holds SecNumCloud qualification at the hosting layer, supporting sovereign hosting of confidential data within the EU. holds ensures that no data is transferred outside the EU, aligning with the client's requirements for data sovereignty." ;
