        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk87> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company's collaboration with a French public AI research laboratory on retrieval-augmented generation and explainability will support the development of a solution that provides reliable and traceable outputs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk88> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "With our company's available capacity, including a dedicated team and the ability to handle parallel engagements, our company's can ensure timely delivery and adequate support throughout the project lifecycle. our company's governance practices, including a joint steering committee, operational committee, RACI matrix, and documented escalation path, will guarantee clear communication, defined roles, and effective issue management." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk89> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address the client's requirements for a coherent tender response, our company's will emphasize our company's ability to provide a tailored solution that integrates with the client's existing systems, supports the client's daily activities, and ensures compliance with regulatory standards." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk9> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Quick access to reliable, up-to-date information drawn from accounting standards (PCG), tax doctrine and the tax code (CGI), the commercial code and applicable legal texts, collective-bargaining agreements for payroll/social, and Cabinet Vauclair & Associés internal procedures and methodology guides." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By highlighting our company's commitment to confidentiality, data sovereignty, and non-decisional support, our company's can demonstrate our company's understanding of the client's needs and constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk91> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Ultimately, our company's approach will focus on delivering a high-quality solution that improves productivity while respecting professional secrecy and auditor independence, thereby ensuring a successful pilot phase and subsequent generalization." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk92> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client expects response times below 2 seconds for common queries, high availability during business hours, resilience against seasonal peak loads, integration with accounting production software, payroll software, document management/ GED, electronic invoicing/dematerialization environment, and API-type interfaces." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk93> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also integrate with the user directory (SSO) and ensure data sovereignty by hosting on SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure or equivalent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our current technology stack, performance benchmarks, sovereign hosting options, and technical constraints as of 2024, can our design a technical architecture that meets these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on the provided context, our company, Faber IA, has a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform called Atelier. a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform called Atelier is composed of several components including a document-ingestion pipeline, vector store, retrieval layer with hybrid search, orchestration layer, and answer layer. our company, Faber IA platform is model-agnostic and can be containerized using Kubernetes. our have two model options: a Sovereign European open-weight model hosted by our company, Faber IA on OuraneCloud, which is fully sovereign, auditable, and has strong grounding/citation behavior but lower raw performance on complex tasks; and top-tier proprietary models accessed via API, which offer higher performance but are operated by non-European providers. our architecture and integration capabilities include API-first design with documented APIs that can be embedded in existing work environments. our have connectors and adapters for accounting production software, payroll software, document management systems (GED), and electronic invoicing/dematerialization environments through our delivery partner, Ligeo Conseil. our support structured extraction where figures and references are linked back to figures and references source passage." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For identity management, our support SSO via SAML and OIDC, and user directories like LDAP and Entra ID." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of performance, our median latency is 1.3 seconds, with a p95 latency below 2.5 seconds for common queries on comparable deployments, depending on the model option and hosting tier. our throughput scales horizontally to accommodate seasonal peak loads." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For hosting, our offer three tiers: a Sovereign tier hosted on OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified, EU-only, and renewable-powered; a High-availability premium tier with additional redundancy and dedicated inference capacity; and an On-premise/hybrid option where the deployment occurs within the client's infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given these capabilities, our can design a technical architecture that meets the client's requirements. our can deploy our Atelier platform on OuraneCloud to ensure data sovereignty and compliance with SecNumCloud qualifications. our Atelier platform integration capabilities can be leveraged to connect with the required software systems (accounting production, payroll, document management, electronic invoicing) through our existing connectors and adapters or by developing new ones as needed. our support for API-type interfaces and SSO integration via user directories will enable seamless interaction with the client's existing infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

